#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:3
msgid "Porting GlobalISel to A New Target"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:5
msgid "There are four major classes to implement by the target:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:7
msgid ""
"{ref}`CallLowering <translator-call-lower>` --- lower calls, returns, and "
"arguments according to the ABI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:9
msgid ""
"{ref}`RegisterBankInfo <api-registerbankinfo>` --- describe {ref}`gmir-"
"regbank` coverage, cross-bank copy cost, and the mapping of operands onto "
"banks for each instruction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:12
msgid ""
"{ref}`LegalizerInfo <api-legalizerinfo>` --- describe what is legal, and how "
"to legalize what isn't."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:14
msgid ""
"{ref}`InstructionSelector <api-instructionselector>` --- select generic MIR "
"to target-specific MIR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:17
msgid "Additionally:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:19
msgid ""
"`TargetPassConfig` --- create the passes constituting the pipeline, "
"including additional passes not included in the {ref}`pipeline`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:22
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GlobalISel/Porting.md:24
msgid ""
"We'd recommend watching [this tutorial](https://www.llvm.org/devmtg/2017-10/"
"#tutorial2) from the 2017 LLVM DevMeeting which gave an overview of how to "
"bring up a new backend in GlobalISel."
msgstr ""
